        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 95,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Simplify the expression inside the square root:\n\\[\n(x-3)^2 - (x-8)^2\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 457,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 458,
        "char_start": 328,
        "effective_step": 3,
        "end_token_index": 160,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 161,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Use the difference of squares formula \\(a^2 - b^2 = (a-b)(a+b)\\):\n\\[\n(x-3)^2 - (x-8)^2 = [(x-3) - (x-8)][(x-3) + (x-8)]\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 595,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 596,
        "char_start": 459,
        "effective_step": 4,
        "end_token_index": 235,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 236,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Simplify the terms inside the brackets:\n\\[\n[(x-3) - (x-8)] = x - 3 - x + 8 = 5\n\\]\n\\[\n[(x-3) + (x-8)] = x - 3 + x - 8 = 2x - 11\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 680,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 681,
        "char_start": 597,
        "effective_step": 5,
        "end_token_index": 261,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 262,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Substitute these simplified terms back into the expression:\n\\[\n5(2x - 11)\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 760,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 761,
        "char_start": 682,
        "effective_step": 6,
        "end_token_index": 295,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 296,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: For the expression to be non-negative, we need:\n\\[\n5(2x - 11) \\geq 0\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 908,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 909,
        "char_start": 762,
        "effective_step": 7,
        "end_token_index": 340,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 341,
        "step_number": 7,
        "text": "Step 7: Since 5 is positive, we can divide both sides of the inequality by 5 without changing the direction of the inequality:\n\\[\n2x - 11 \\geq 0\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 976,
